<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4551] Reconsider cache key/value peer class loading</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4551</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In new cache implementation after entry is written in offheap information about key/value classloaders in lost (before classloader ids were stored in swap/offheap see GridCacheMapEntry.swap in &apos;master&apos;).&lt;br/&gt;
Need decide how it should work with new architecture (maybe single type per cache can simplify implementation).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13035292">IGNITE-4551</key>
            <summary>Reconsider cache key/value peer class loading</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
                                            <priority id="3" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/major.svg">Major</priority>
                        <status id="5" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png" description="A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.">Resolved</status>
                    <statusCategory id="3" key="done" colorName="green"/>
                                    <resolution id="2">Won&apos;t Fix</resolution>
                                        <assignee username="agoncharuk">Alexey Goncharuk</assignee>
                                    <reporter username="agoncharuk">Alexey Goncharuk</reporter>
                        <labels>
                            <label>MakeTeamcityGreenAgain</label>
                            <label>Muted_test</label>
                    </labels>
                <created>Mon, 16 Jan 2017 18:22:18 +0000</created>
                <updated>Fri, 14 Dec 2018 12:42:41 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Mon, 9 Apr 2018 14:08:55 +0000</resolved>
                                                    <fixVersion>2.5</fixVersion>
                                    <component>cache</component>
                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>1</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15926587" author="ntikhonov" created="Wed, 15 Mar 2017 17:18:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;As possible solution we can propagate &lt;tt&gt;KeyClassloaderId&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;ValueClassLoaderId&lt;/tt&gt; to &lt;tt&gt;DataRow&lt;/tt&gt;, similar did for &lt;tt&gt;expireTime&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16019608" author="ntikhonov" created="Mon, 22 May 2017 14:07:36 +0000"  >&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Added into &lt;tt&gt;CacheDataRow&lt;/tt&gt; new methods &lt;tt&gt;keyClassLoaderId&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;valueClassLoaderId&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;deploymentEnabled&lt;/tt&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Updated &lt;tt&gt;writeFragmentData&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;writeRowData&lt;/tt&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Updated &lt;tt&gt;readData&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;readFragmentData&lt;/tt&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Link to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite/tree/ignite-4551&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;github&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16430575" author="agoncharuk" created="Mon, 9 Apr 2018 14:08:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I do not think this is an issue because we moved towards binary marshaller&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16721264" author="dpavlov" created="Fri, 14 Dec 2018 11:28:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; should we delete org.apache.ignite.internal.managers.deployment.GridDeploymentMessageCountSelfTest#testCacheValueDeploymentOnPut ?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16721322" author="agoncharuk" created="Fri, 14 Dec 2018 12:01:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt;, yes, the test can be deleted.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16721362" author="dpavlov" created="Fri, 14 Dec 2018 12:42:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; done, thanks&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
